# Statistics (exact tests; small n)

- Normal load, cost (replica_minutes): agent (n=4, mean 71.5) < hpa (n=4, mean 76.3): one-sided exact permutation p = 0.014; the other way p = 1.000
- Normal load, NFR violation (nfr_violation_s): agent (n=4, mean 107.5) < hpa (n=4, mean 0.0): one-sided exact permutation p = 1.000; the other way p = 0.014
- stuck: recovered, agent 4/4 vs hpa 0/4: one-sided Fisher exact p = 0.0143
- cpuhog: recovered, agent 3/4 vs hpa 0/4: one-sided Fisher exact p = 0.0714
- Faults pooled: agent 7/8 vs hpa 0/8: one-sided Fisher exact p = 0.00070

